WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.775
The cat sat on the basket.

2
00:00:07.776 --> 00:00:12.160
"When will she leave?" whispered Benjamin.

3
00:00:12.161 --> 00:00:16.859
"Father will be looking for me."

4
00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:22.082
"These onions smell awful!" whispered Peter.

5
00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:25.407
Tears filled his eyes.

6
00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:28.391
The cat did not leave.

7
00:00:28.392 --> 00:00:33.701
She sat on the basket for five hours!

8
00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:36.883
At last they heard something.

9
00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:40.095
"Benjamin?" someone called.

10
00:00:40.096 --> 00:00:44.618
"That's Father!" whispered Benjamin.

11
00:00:44.619 --> 00:00:48.352
The cat looked up at the wall.

12
00:00:48.353 --> 00:00:55.488
Suddenly a large rabbit jumped down.

13
00:00:55.489 --> 00:00:58.726
Wham! He kicked the cat.

14
00:00:58.727 --> 00:01:03.183
Slam! He pushed her inside the greenhouse. Then—

15
00:01:03.184 --> 00:01:10.944
bang! He locked the door.

16
00:01:10.945 --> 00:01:16.310
Benjamin's father lifted the basket.

17
00:01:16.311 --> 00:01:27.242
"You are in big trouble, Benjamin," he said.

18
00:01:27.243 --> 00:01:31.800
Later that day the farmer returned from town.

19
00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:35.396
"What happened?" he cried.

20
00:01:35.397 --> 00:01:39.525
Small footprints were everywhere.

21
00:01:39.526 --> 00:01:46.405
The scarecrow's clothes were gone.

22
00:01:46.406 --> 00:02:13.168
And the cat was locked in the greenhouse!

23
00:02:13.169 --> 00:02:21.239
Mrs. Rabbit was upset with Peter.

24
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.643
But she was glad to see him.

25
00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:30.564
"You're safe, Peter," she said.

26
00:02:30.565 --> 00:02:41.332
"And you got your clothes back!"

